sequenceDiagram
 participant A0 as Traveler UI
 participant A1 as Replan service
 participant A2 as AI and routing
 participant A3 as PostgreSQL
 A0->>A1: 1. Request remaining-day preview for owned trip/revision
 A1->>A3: 2. Read current trip and enforce shared rate budget
 A1->>A2: 3. Validate only remaining IDs, durations and transfers
 A1->>A0: 4. Return signed 15-minute owner/trip/revision preview
 A0->>A1: 5. Accept with confirmation, or cancel without plan write
 A1->>A3: 6. Lock and reject stale/expired/wrong-owner preview
 A1->>A3: 7. Apply permitted changes and append version/history
 A1->>A0: 8. Return saved plan and new revision
